From da20e82818904557fcd926c483ba3d1eaa2499aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: G98 LEDE maintainers <lede@bdy-g98.local>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 21:39:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: rk3588: add BDY G98 support

Add the BDY G98 target, device trees and board-specific storage routing.

Enable UART, SARADC recovery, RockUSB, PCIe/NVMe, USB and MMC support.

Derive boot targets from the detected SPI-NOR or eMMC boot source.

Signed-off-by: G98 LEDE maintainers <lede@bdy-g98.local>
